# Plasmo Voice settings screen translations (UTF-8).
# Format: key=value. Lines starting with # are comments. \n is a line break in tooltips.
# Keep %s, %1$s, %d and %% exactly as they are.
# Missing keys fall back to the built-in text, then to English.
# Delete this file to get a fresh copy from the mod on the next start.
# Server messages are translated in config/plasmovoice/languages/, not here.

