gui.plasmovoice.volume.voice_leveling=Voice Leveling
gui.plasmovoice.volume.voice_leveling.tooltip=Automatically turns down players with loud microphones and gently boosts quiet ones, so everyone sounds about equally loud.\n\nDistance, occlusion and your player volumes still apply on top.\n\nApplies to the players you hear.
gui.plasmovoice.volume.voice_leveling_target=Target Level
gui.plasmovoice.volume.voice_leveling_target.tooltip=Speech level that players are leveled to.\n\nHigher is louder.

